00:04:56,470 --> 00:05:02,470
Life is about the choices we make.

2
00:09:52,941 --> 00:09:58,941
A Kiss Before Christmas is a tv movie, romance,
comedy film directed by Jeff Beesley.

3
00:14:49,411 --> 00:14:55,411
Ethan, always the nice guy, wakes up in a new reality at Christmas.

4
00:19:45,882 --> 00:19:51,882
Initially, he is enthralled with his new life but soon
realizes that it's not what he thought it would be.

5
00:24:42,352 --> 00:24:48,352
Joyce, played by Teri Hatcher.

6
00:29:38,823 --> 00:29:44,823
Ethan Holt, played by James Denton.

7
00:34:35,294 --> 00:34:41,294
Rona, played by Marilu Henner.

8
00:39:31,764 --> 00:39:37,764
Colin, played by Carson Kroeker.

9
00:44:28,235 --> 00:44:34,235
Tisha, played by Sophia Elena Bachart.

10
00:49:24,705 --> 00:49:30,705
Santa, played by John B. Lowe.

11
00:54:21,176 --> 00:54:27,176
Last Christmas is a 2019 Christmas romantic comedy film directed by Paul Feig and written by Bryony
Kimmings and Emma Thompson, who co-developed the story concept with her husband, Greg Wise.

12
00:59:17,647 --> 00:59:23,647
Based on the 1984 song of the same name by Wham!, the film stars Emilia Clarke as a disillusioned Christmas store worker who forms a
relationship with a mysterious man (Henry Golding) and begins to fall for him; Thompson and Michelle Yeoh also star.

13
01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
Last Christmas was theatrically released in the United States on 8 November 2019
and in the United Kingdom on 15 November 2019 by Universal Pictures.

14
01:09:10,588 --> 01:09:16,588
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the performances and chemistry
of Clarke and Golding, but criticised the screenplay and story.

15
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
The film grossed $123 million worldwide.

16
01:19:03,529 --> 01:19:09,529
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
